# 13. Terraform EKS Module

Instead of writing everything manually, use modules.

Example:

```text id="z7m3x9"

Terraform

    |

EKS Module

    |

Creates:

- Control Plane
- Node Groups
- IAM
- Security Groups

```

---

# 14. EKS Terraform Example

Example:

```hcl id="m5x8q2"

module "eks" {

 source = "terraform-aws-modules/eks/aws"


 cluster_name = "production"


 cluster_version = "1.31"

}

```

---

# 15. Node Group Automation

Terraform creates:

```text id="n8q2m6"

EKS Cluster

      |

Node Group

      |

EC2 Instances

      |

Pods

```

---

Example:

```hcl id="p7m4x1"

managed_node_groups = {

 general = {

