# 17. Terraform Modules

Modules organize reusable code.

Example:

```text id="r8m2k4"

modules/


vpc/

 ├── main.tf


eks/

 ├── main.tf


iam/

 ├── main.tf

```

---

Benefits:

* Reuse
* Standardization
* Easier maintenance

