# 19. Terraform Best Practices

## Use Remote State

✅ S3
✅ DynamoDB Locking

---

## Use Modules

Avoid:

```text
One huge main.tf
```

---

## Use Variables

Avoid hardcoding.

---

## Use Version Control

Store:

```text
Terraform Code

+

Git History
```

---

## Separate Environments

Example:

```text id="u5m8x7"

dev/

terraform.tfvars


stage/

terraform.tfvars


prod/

terraform.tfvars

```

